:: House Dry Off [nobr]

You strip off your clothes and dry them off.<br>
<<set $Wet to 0>>
<<set $Wetness to 0>>
<<storeClothing "Store" "Undies" 1>>

<br>

<div id='Dressed'>
<<link "Get Dressed">>
<<replace"#Dressed">>

    <<storeClothing "Restore" "Undies">>

Once dry, you get dressed without incident.<br>
<br>
[[Continue|PH Bathroom]] 
<</replace>>
<</link>>
</div>
